sequenceDiagram
    participant User as kubectl rhaii-validate<br/>(User Workstation)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant GPUJob as GPU Check Agent<br/>(Privileged Pod)
    participant HW as GPU/RDMA Hardware<br/>(sysfs, nvidia-smi, ibstat)
    participant IperfS as iperf3 Server<br/>5201/TCP
    participant IperfC as iperf3 Client
    participant LatS as TCP Latency Server<br/>12865/TCP
    participant LatC as TCP Latency Client
    participant BWS as ib_write_bw Server<br/>18515+/TCP
    participant BWC as ib_write_bw Client
    participant PMS as ibv_rc_pingpong Server
    participant PMC as ibv_rc_pingpong Client

    Note over User,K8sAPI: Phase 0: Platform Detection & Setup
    User->>K8sAPI: List nodes (detect platform: OCP/AKS/EKS/CoreWeave)<br/>Auth: kubeconfig
    K8sAPI-->>User: Node list with labels & provider IDs
    User->>K8sAPI: Create namespace, ServiceAccount, RBAC<br/>Auth: kubeconfig
    K8sAPI-->>User: Resources created

    Note over User,HW: Tier 1: CRD & Operator Health Checks (no Jobs)
    User->>K8sAPI: List CRDs (Gateway API, InferencePool, LWS, cert-manager)
    K8sAPI-->>User: CRD presence results
    User->>K8sAPI: List pods in operator namespaces<br/>(cert-manager, istio-system, openshift-lws-operator)
    K8sAPI-->>User: Pod health status

    Note over User,HW: Tier 2: Per-Node GPU & RDMA Topology (Jobs)
    User->>K8sAPI: Create GPU check Job (per GPU node)
    K8sAPI->>GPUJob: Schedule on target node (nodeSelector)
    GPUJob->>HW: nvidia-smi / rocm-smi (driver, ECC, device enum)
    HW-->>GPUJob: GPU hardware data
    GPUJob->>HW: ibstat / ibv_devices (RDMA NIC state, topology)
    HW-->>GPUJob: RDMA topology (NUMA, PCIe hierarchy)
    GPUJob-->>K8sAPI: Pod logs (structured JSON)
    User->>K8sAPI: Collect Job logs
    K8sAPI-->>User: Per-node GPU/RDMA topology reports

    Note over User,PMC: Tier 3a: TCP Bandwidth & Latency Tests
    User->>K8sAPI: Create iperf3 server Job on server node
    K8sAPI->>IperfS: Schedule server pod
    User->>K8sAPI: Create iperf3 client Jobs on client nodes
    K8sAPI->>IperfC: Schedule client pods
    IperfC->>IperfS: TCP bandwidth test (5201/TCP, no encryption)
    IperfS-->>IperfC: Throughput results
    User->>K8sAPI: Create TCP latency server Job
    K8sAPI->>LatS: Schedule latency server
    User->>K8sAPI: Create TCP latency client Jobs
    K8sAPI->>LatC: Schedule latency clients
    LatC->>LatS: TCP echo latency test (12865/TCP)
    LatS-->>LatC: Latency measurements
    User->>K8sAPI: Collect bandwidth/latency logs

    Note over User,PMC: Tier 3b: RDMA Bandwidth Tests (per GPU-NIC pair)
    User->>K8sAPI: Create ib_write_bw server Job
    K8sAPI->>BWS: Schedule on server node
    User->>K8sAPI: Create ib_write_bw client Jobs (per GPU-NIC pair)
    K8sAPI->>BWC: Schedule on client nodes
    BWC->>BWS: RDMA write bandwidth (18515+/TCP, GPUDirect CUDA)
    BWS-->>BWC: Bandwidth results (per-device & whole-endpoint)

    Note over User,PMC: Tier 3c: RDMA Pingmesh (full-mesh connectivity)
    User->>K8sAPI: Create pingmesh Jobs (round-robin tournament)
    K8sAPI->>PMS: Schedule server pods (disjoint pairs)
    K8sAPI->>PMC: Schedule client pods (disjoint pairs)
    PMC->>PMS: ibv_rc_pingpong (RDMA verbs, dynamic ports)
    PMS-->>PMC: Connectivity result (pass/fail per NIC pair)

    Note over User,K8sAPI: Phase 4: Report & Cleanup
    User->>K8sAPI: Store report in ConfigMap<br/>(rhaii-validate-report)
    User->>K8sAPI: Store pingmesh failures in ConfigMap<br/>(rhaii-validate-pingmesh-failures)
    User->>K8sAPI: Delete Jobs, RBAC resources
    K8sAPI-->>User: Cleanup complete
    Note over User: Output: structured JSON or table report
